## Agrupar Seletores ##

<style>
  .nt {
     background: orange;
     opacity: 0.50;	
     border-radius: 3mm;
     text-align: center;
     padding : 2mm;
  }
  
</style>

<table border=0> 
    <tr>
    	<td colspan=5 class=nt> Seletores </td>
	<td rowspan=2> </td>
	<td rowspan=2 class=nt> Declaração </td>
